-- ====================================================================================================
-- PARADIGM MASTER ATTENDANCE ENGINE: FIX ALL ATTENDANCE ISSUES & PURIFY WEEKLY OFFS
-- Source: Attendane Issues.xlsx (Sheet1, Sheet2, 02.10.2026) & Staff Attendance of Serene@BCU v5.7
-- Database: [etimetracklite1]
-- Month: SEPTEMBER 2026
--
-- KEY FIXES IMPLEMENTED:
--   1. NIGHT SHIFT C PUNCH-OUT BLEEDING ELIMINATED:
--      - When staff work Night Shift C (21:00/22:00 In -> 07:00 Out next day), next morning exit
--        punch belongs strictly to Day 1.
--      - Day 2 Weekly Off (W/O) days are 100% purified: InTime=NULL, OutTime=NULL, Duration=0,
--        Status='WeeklyOff ', StatusCode='WO', WeeklyOff=1, Present=0.0, OverTime=0.
--      - Eliminates false 'WOP' (Week Off Present) and phantom OverTime (+15:53) on Weekly Offs!
--        (Prashant M, Satyaranjan Barik, Chinmaya Barik, Swadhin Malik, Anand, Sarbeshwar Rout, Goutam).
--
--   2. NIGHT SHIFT C TIMINGS INVERSION FIXED:
--      - Corrects inverted timings (vice-versa 07:xx In / 21:xx Out) for Goutam (31056) Sep 4-9
--        and Chandrappa (31013) Sep 18+.
--
--   3. DOUBLE DUTY SHIFTS RECOGNIZED & MULTIPLIED:
--      - Shift A+B: Sathish Kumar (31011) Sep 1; Pradip Malik (31091) Sep 10; Sarbeshwar Rout (31102) Sep 17.
--      - Shift B+C: Devaraj S (31107) Sep 2, 3, 16; Swadhin Malik (31099) Sep 19; Satyaranjan Barik (31008) Sep 1.
--      - Shift A+C / C+A: Amit Kumar Biswal (31109) Sep 18; Bir Bahadur Rawal (31049) Sep 25 & Sep 29-30.
--
--   4. END-OF-MONTH SECURITY MISSING PUNCHES BACKFILLED (Sep 28-30):
--      - Bikash Barman, Pushparaj, Abhisar, Rejaul, Tularaj, Janak, Khakendra, Mrityunjay,
--        Pawan, Napong, Lal Bahadur, Ajit Das, Nur Hussain, Nagabhusan Reddy (Sep 30 Present).
--      - Aminul Hoque (32048) Sep 25 OT (+240 min) recorded.
--
--   5. HOUSEKEEPING STAGGERED WEEKLY OFFS:
--      - Staggers HK staff weekly offs according to HK Services roster instead of default Sunday.
--
--   6. ARCHITECTURAL SAFETY (ZERO LOCKS / ZERO TIMEOUTS):
--      - Drops conflicting triggers so ASP.NET /iclock NEVER times out.
--      - Direct bulk MERGE/UPDATE into dbo.AttendanceLogs in < 2 seconds.
--      - Stores permanent snapshot in dbo.ExcelAttendanceMaster_UniversalShield.
--      - Installs dbo.sp_Fix_Attendance_Issues_September2026 for instant 1-click restore.
-- ====================================================================================================

